  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Some user thumbnail images on the website weight a couple of MBs (e.g. 8 MB) and have ridiculously high resolution (found a 3840x2160 one). \n\nThis is bad for bandwidth / mobile data. \n\nIt also means there's probably not good enough compression or upload limits.\n\nSteps to easily find these kind of thumbnails:\n\nDevtools->Network->Filter for Img.\n\nNow in your right wing scroll your friends list up and down to download a bunch of thumbnails.",
